<item><title>Thugge backs Treasury plan to centralise county deposits at CBK</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ke/thugge-backs-treasury-plan-to-centralise-county-deposits-at-0b94f5/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ke/thugge-backs-treasury-plan-to-centralise-county-deposits-at-0b94f5/</guid><category>Kenya</category><description>The proposed law would require counties to get written Treasury approval before opening or closing accounts and move their funds into a single account.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 05:51:04 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ke.jpg" length="31123" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ke.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
